versionEdits.description:
Tracks the version history of an object, which is only active if version history tracking is enabled. This field is
crucial for accessing previous versions of an object and is entirely managed by the system.

@see Ann.Db#versionHistory

title:
This type represents an object that is both trainable and processable for machine learning purposes.

Parametrization:
@var DX type for "x"/"input" data for training
@var DY type for "y"/"label" data for supervised training
@var DS type for scoring context
@var DO type for output for processing
@var DI type for output for interpreting
DEVELOPER NOTE: DX, DY, DS, DO, DI should be immutable. This means the types should not mixin {@link Mutable}! In future versions,
this will be strictly enforced as a {@link MetadataIssue}.

@see MlOperationSpec
@see MlPipeline
@see MlAtomicPipe
